  <item>
    <title>第二十一期 新年杂谈</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65a742f02e26fb993413f034</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65a742f02e26fb993413f034</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 17 Jan 2024 03:01:04 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>亲爱的听众朋友们，我们回来了！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期简而言之便是昨天今天明天，回顾2023年的阅读经历，推荐手边正在阅读的书籍，并且展望2024的阅读计划。</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. 大家最近在读的书籍，推荐的理由：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">1:05</a> 思琪推荐《战争与和平》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="195">3:15</a> 老杨推荐卡夫卡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1646">27:26</a> 老孙推荐《瓦尔登湖》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2471">41:11</a> 思琪推荐推荐《战争与和平》的李翊云</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2760">46:00</a> 老方推荐几首小诗和《冬牧场》</span></p><span></span><p><span>2. 2023年的阅读回顾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3605">1:00:05</a> 老杨和老孙的简短回顾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4080">1:08:00</a> 思琪回顾阅读李翊云</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4975">1:22:55</a> 老方的简短回顾</span></p><span></span><p><span>3. 阅读计划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5188">1:26:28</a> 老孙的阅读计划：《国富论》，《伯罗奔尼撒战争史》，《维特根斯坦》，马太福音的神学注释。 倪柝声《工作的再思》，富能仁的传记《山雨》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5880">1:38:00</a> 老杨的阅读计划：莎士比亚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6270">1:44:30</a> 思琪的阅读计划：《战争与和平》，《The Moons of Jupiter》，《Desiring God》， 《Suffering and the Sovereignty of God》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6410">1:46:50</a> 老方的阅读计划：莎士比亚，马识途，堂吉诃德</span></p><span></span><p><span>播客中提到的书影音：</span></p><span></span><p><span>托尔斯泰《战争与和平》</span></p><span></span><p><span>卡夫卡《卡夫卡中短篇小说选》</span></p><span></span><p><span>梭罗《瓦尔登湖》</span></p><span></span><p><span>李翊云 "All will be well"，《Tolstoy Together: 85 Days of War and Peace with Yiyun Li》，《Where reasons end》</span></p><span></span><p><span>Alice Munro《The Moons of Jupiter》</span></p><span></span><p><span>John Piper 《Desiring God》，《Suffering and the Sovereignty of God》</span></p><span></span><p><span>亚当斯密《国富论》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《伯罗奔尼撒战争史》</span></p><span></span><p><span>塞万提斯《堂吉诃德》</span></p><span></span><p><span>李娟《冬牧场》</span></p><span></span><p><span>英剧《新贵》</span></p><span></span><p><span>莱姆《索拉里斯星》</span></p><span></span><p><span>播客《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6249100a789d16d27f522da2" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6249100a789d16d27f522da2"><span>自由发挥</span></a><span>》</span></p><span></span><p><span>老杨的文章《</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv29672804/" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv29672804/"><span>坦塔罗斯</span></a><span>》</span></p><span></span><p><span>老孙的剧本《</span><a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1zCDRYTBLBS9TaMZJ5M3hqkwY9pbxY5bp/edit?usp=sharing&amp;ouid=109573190537466840333&amp;rtpof=true&amp;sd=true" data-url="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1zCDRYTBLBS9TaMZJ5M3hqkwY9pbxY5bp/edit?usp=sharing&amp;ouid=109573190537466840333&amp;rtpof=true&amp;sd=true"><span>重返伊甸园</span></a><span>》</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：老方 老孙 老杨 思琪</span></p>]]></description>
