  <item>
    <title>第十六期 古都 川端康成</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62bbb498c2e48b4266cc22c6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62bbb498c2e48b4266cc22c6</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 01 Jul 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“喏，千重子，爸爸对树木不太在行，但樟树是不是南国的树种，生长在气候温暖的地方呢？热海和九州一带都盛产吧？这里的樟树，虽说是老树，但令人感到好像是大盆景一样。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>“这不就是京都吗？不论是山、是河，还是人，都……”千重子说。</span></p><span></span><p><span>-《古都》，川端康成</span></p><span></span><p><span>《古都》既是写一对命运迥异的双胞胎的情感故事，也是一本获诺贝尔文学奖的古都”旅游手册”。这期我们将从素材和情节的安排，对话赏析，人物评析等方面一起来讨论《古都》这部小说。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">1:00</a> 故事梗概</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="160">2:40</a> 古都在写法上的特点：素材与情节的安排</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1525">25:25</a> 古都中有营养的对话赏析</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3427">57:07</a> 古都打动人的地方</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4068">1:07:48</a> 番外闲聊</span></p><span></span><p><span>主讲人：孙，杨</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnqnFwvSYSfwTuoQgXo8h8ojpUuo.m4a" length="144343402" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:14:46</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjj-Hqd6scNa1DqhQvyB088uYEiQ.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>第十五期 米斯特拉尔诗选 米斯特拉尔</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62b39866e0f14bf866e7d335</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62b39866e0f14bf866e7d335</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 22 Jun 2022 22:32:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>I will walk, unknowing, my road</span></p><span></span><p><span>toward the sea bearing in these hands,</span></p><span></span><p><span>like an ashen fish, my daughter,</span></p><span></span><p><span>lighter now than her tresses,</span></p><span></span><p><span>and from this coal we all will burn,</span></p><span></span><p><span>Agamemnon, unto the last day:</span></p><span></span><p><span>your palace, your myrtles, your doves,</span></p><span></span><p><span>with a King of men and a mad Queen. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-"</span><strong><span>Clytemnestra", </span></strong><span>Mistral</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期我们会走进智利诗人，诺贝尔奖得主米斯特拉尔的诗，看这样一位女性外交官，教育家，诗人所谱写出的动人诗篇。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="59">00:59</a> 生平介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="172">2:52</a> 羞怯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="710">11:50</a> 致孩子们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1524">25:24</a> 对星星的承诺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1940">32:20</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;黎明</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2409">40:09</a> &nbsp;凯楚阿民歌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3060">51:00</a> &nbsp;克吕泰涅斯特拉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3927">1:05:27</a> 女性视角的一般性讨论</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv17229843" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv17229843"><span>文中提及的诗的链接</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://anchor.fm/xu-yang" data-url="https://anchor.fm/xu-yang"><span>RSS链接</span></a><span>（包含Spotify, Apple podcast等其他平台）</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：方，孙，杨</span></p>]]></description>
