  <item>
    <title>第十四期 诗集《黄草》 方汉隆</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6239396e81cda5f203801c72</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6239396e81cda5f203801c72</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Mar 2022 02:50:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今夜 三十岁</span></p><span></span><p><span>蓝色的大海里</span></p><span></span><p><span>舀起红色的酒</span></p><span></span><p><span>你就这样红了脸</span></p><span></span><p><span>烧起的热的血液</span></p><span></span><p><span>拥抱了世界 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-老方</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目我们会探讨斯人雅会主播/青年数学家/诗人老方的诗，透过老方的艺术一窥他那颗悸动不安的诗人的灵魂。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">2:20</a> 黄草</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="445">7:25</a> 致西曼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1026">17:06</a> 一元还是二元</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1810">30:10</a> 致惠英二首</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2838">47:18</a> 无题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3200">53:20</a> 老杨说，因为晴天，所以雨眠</span></p><span></span><p><span>老方诗集的链接：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv15786582" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv15786582"><span>《黄草》</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>主讲人：杨 孙</span></p><span></span><p><span>客座嘉宾：京睿，Penfield （meow）</span></p>]]></description>
